## Pathfinding System
// Implementation of:
// - @battle-performance-standards.mdc#Core-Requirements#Movement-Efficiency
// - @battle-targeting-system.mdc#Target-Acquisition#Path-Calculation

### Core Rules
- Calculate shortest path using network topology
- Only use network lines for movement
- Stop at nodes for direction changes
- Update paths on target movement or state changes

